1
00:00:00,063 --> 00:00:01,693
(Leonard:)What do we do...
kick them off?

2
00:00:01,697 --> 00:00:03,267
(Penny:)If we drop them off
at a fire station,

3
00:00:03,266 --> 00:00:06,196
they have to take them;
no questions asked.

4
00:00:06,202 --> 00:00:10,272
(Sheldon:)Before you do, please
give me one more chance

5
00:00:10,273 --> 00:00:12,273
(Sheldon:)to apologize to Emily.

6
00:00:12,275 --> 00:00:14,005
(Raj:)Oh, God.

7
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:17,140
(Sheldon:)Emily, as I'm
sure you know,

8
00:00:17,146 --> 00:00:20,046
(Sheldon:)I'm considered
an odd fellow.

9
00:00:22,118 --> 00:00:23,918
(Sheldon:)But what you don't know
is that, while I often

10
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:27,490
(Sheldon:)say the wrong thing,
in my heart I mean well.

11
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,390
(Sheldon:)I think that you are

12
00:00:29,392 --> 00:00:32,392
(Sheldon:)a smart and wonderful
woman, you know?

13
00:00:32,395 --> 00:00:36,035
(Sheldon:)And we all think that you can
do better than Koothrappali.

14
00:00:37,066 --> 00:00:38,696
(Raj:)You know, Sheldon...

15
00:00:38,701 --> 00:00:41,501
(Emily:)Shh, let him finish.

16
00:00:41,504 --> 00:00:43,474
(Sheldon:)So, for all the times
I've offended you

17
00:00:43,473 --> 00:00:46,043
(Sheldon:)and all the times that
I'll offend you in the future,

18
00:00:46,042 --> 00:00:48,942
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

19
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:51,780
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

20
00:00:51,781 --> 00:00:53,211
(Leonard:)Good.

21
00:00:53,216 --> 00:00:55,316
(Sheldon:)Then I'll be leaving now.

22
00:00:55,318 --> 00:00:57,618
(Emily:)Oh, it's okay, Sheldon.

23
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:59,790
(Emily:)Come with us.

24
00:00:59,789 --> 00:01:02,089
(Sheldon:)Oh, that's very kind of you.

25
00:01:02,091 --> 00:01:04,621
(Sheldon:)But I'm sure you'll all have
a better time without me.

26
00:01:04,627 --> 00:01:06,127
(Sheldon:)Let's go, Stuart.

27
00:01:06,129 --> 00:01:07,629
(Stuart:)But I want to stay.

28
00:01:07,630 --> 00:01:08,960
Stuart, now!

29
00:01:16,305 --> 00:01:17,775
(Sheldon:)You know,
I know he's a jerk,

30
00:01:17,773 --> 00:01:19,473
(Emily:)but I actually
feel bad for him.

31
00:01:19,475 --> 00:01:23,415
(Penny:)And now you see
the problem.

32
00:01:25,581 --> 00:01:28,981
Come on, you pain in the ass!

33
00:01:28,985 --> 00:01:30,355
That's me!

34
00:01:30,353 --> 00:01:31,823
(Sheldon:)Bye, Stuart.

35
00:01:31,821 --> 00:01:33,921
Wait!

36
00:01:33,923 --> 00:01:37,363
I'm a pain in the ass, too!

37
00:01:43,226 --> 00:01:45,426
(Sheldon:)Are you relieved
that you and Raj

38
00:01:45,429 --> 00:01:47,429
(Sheldon:)were able
to patch things up?

39
00:01:47,431 --> 00:01:48,961
(Emily:)At the moment?

40
00:01:48,965 --> 00:01:50,965
(Emily:)No, not really.

41
00:01:50,967 --> 00:01:52,397
♪ Burn, baby, burn... ♪

42
00:01:52,402 --> 00:01:54,172
Shake it, baby!

43
00:01:54,171 --> 00:01:56,971
(whoops)
Work that thing!

